# kimiya — physical and universal constants
#
# GENERATED by scripts/oracle from kimiya 1.2.0 (rust-old/), hisab 1.4.0. Do not edit.
# Regenerate: cargo run --release --locked --manifest-path scripts/oracle/Cargo.toml
#
# Each value is the shortest decimal that round-trips to the oracle's f64, written out
# positionally: the Cyrius lexer has no exponent notation, and decimal literals are
# correctly rounded (6.6.10+). tests/golden/constants.tsv pins every bit.
#
# Module data constants (K_b/K_f, Madelung, Born exponents, Λ°, Debye–Hückel, K_w, STP,
# water's specific heat) are generated with their module at its milestone, not here.

